# Security backports for PHP 8.1 from Ondřej Surý's Debian packaging:
# https://salsa.debian.org/php-team/php, branch debian/main/8.1.
# Reviewed against 8.1.34-9 (commit 4e430ad).
#
# One line per entry in debian/patches/series, in series order:
#   apply <sha256> <patch>   applied to php-src; the hash must still match
#   skip  <patch>  # why     never applied
# build/fetch-backports.sh fails the build on any patch added to the series,
# changed, or removed since this review — read it, then list it here.
